OL,3,GNEWSAMissing Lillia found, police say
OL,4,
OL,5,FA schoolgirl who went missing, sparking
OL,6,Fa major search operation, has been
OL,7,Ffound.
OL,9,FLillia, 13, from Bolton, was last seen
OL,10,Fby her family more than a week ago.
OL,12,FGreater Manchester Police confirmed the
OL,13,Fteenager had been found safe and well
OL,14,Fin the city centre.
OL,16,FIn a Facebook post, the force said her
OL,17,Ffamily had been informed.
